    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>You crashed into the world's most valuable museum! Grab as many valuable pieces without getting caught by the security guards and police officers!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore The Massive Museums</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823050/extras/576266f96f1374e2048a6564f9f26243.poster.avif?t=1752933285\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823050/extras/576266f96f1374e2048a6564f9f26243.webm?t=1752933285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823050/extras/576266f96f1374e2048a6564f9f26243.mp4?t=1752933285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prehistoric Dinosaur Area, Space Exhibit, Science Museum, and More to explore and discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal Everything. Even the Guards &amp; Officers!!!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823050/extras/9a4ec5b9c49d4c1213989455b3e2f061.poster.avif?t=1752933285\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823050/extras/9a4ec5b9c49d4c1213989455b3e2f061.webm?t=1752933285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823050/extras/9a4ec5b9c49d4c1213989455b3e2f061.mp4?t=1752933285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost everything you see, you can steal. From art pieces, to dinosaur skeletons, to people, to the bathroom sign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful High-Speed Powerups</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823050/extras/f84d61f1bc54846bc184a0e8c25d5ccc.poster.avif?t=1752933285\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823050/extras/f84d61f1bc54846bc184a0e8c25d5ccc.webm?t=1752933285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823050/extras/f84d61f1bc54846bc184a0e8c25d5ccc.mp4?t=1752933285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint through the map with fun, high speed ramps that give you a boost as you travel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rank in the Online Leaderboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3823050/extras/c1f50596cd634829aa4bfc4d8c8a4b3c.avif?t=1752933285\" width=800 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against gamers all around the world to score the highest value and the fastest time.\u00a0</p>",
